    "text": "A galvanometer of resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math> is connected to a battery of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> along with a resistance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2950</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math> in series. A full-scale deflection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn></math> divisions is obtained in the galvanometer. In order to reduce this deflection to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math> divisions, the resistance in series should be",
